{
  "headline": "Insulin human is not on FDA's shortage list; Baxter plant classified OAI 2026-04-02 with warning letter 2026-09-29 and ongoing Class II recall 2026-08-06; Corvale Lakeside has 16.7 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E10", "E11", "E14", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows insulin human is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Baxter Healthcare Corporation plant (FEI 1416980) that manufactures a labeled insulin human product was classified OAI on 2026-04-02 per inspection 1311078.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a warning letter to that plant on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An ongoing Class II recall (D-0806-2026) for Baxter's insulin human in 0.9% sodium chloride injection was initiated 2026-08-06 for CGMP deviations.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 51 units at 3.1 per day, giving 16.7 days on hand, the lowest of the three sites.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East and Corvale General have 26.8 and 27.7 days on hand respectively.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-recommended option is to buy from Eli Lilly and Company, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
